e. women crisis centres;
f. advisory boards for marriage guidance and preservation;
g. police;
h. prosecutors;
i. courts;
j. Ministry of Religious Affairs; and/or legal aid organizations;

Article 7

The obligations of the Regional Government in efforts to protect women include:
a. establish and implement policy programs and activities for the protection of women's rights;
