WEST SUMATRA PROVINCE

REGIONAL REGULATION OF DHARMASRAYA REGENCY

NUMBER 16 OF 2018

CONCERNING

WOMEN EMPOWERMENT AND CHILD PROTECTION

BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

REGENT OF DHARMASRAYA,

Considering:
a. that women and children have the right to obtain a sense of security and freedom from all forms of torture or treatment that degrades human dignity; b. that women and children are vulnerable groups who tend to experience violence, therefore they need to receive optimal protection;
c. that the fulfillment of constitutional rights of women and children as well as the improvement of the quality of life of women and children, is one of the mandatory affairs which is the duty, authority and responsibility of the Regional Government; d. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b and letter c, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Women Empowerment and Child Protection;

